1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,488
Pintal gelung kertas separuh pusingan, kemudian gunting di tengah.

2
00:00:04,788 --> 00:00:05,971
Dua gelung?

3
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:06,562
Bukan.

4
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:09,765
Ia terbuka menjadi satu gelung panjang.

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,340
Ikut satu separuh.

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,826
Pintalan menyambungkannya ke separuh lain.

7
00:00:14,126 --> 00:00:17,253
Jadi kedua-dua separuh satu jalur, dua kali panjang.

8
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:21,290
Gunting satu pertiga dari tepi: dua gelung, bersangkut.

9
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:22,538
Dua?
